    'Downloads each language’s pronunciations from an online voice once, so the phrasebook’s speaker then works with no signal. There is one audio quality — the online voice does not offer a choice. Lao has no online voice to download from at all yet (tracked separately); this app’s other phrasebook languages already have a voice built into most phones, so a downloaded pack would not buy them anything.': null,
